      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing a Provider**\n\nI'm currently focused on selecting a concrete external provider for image labeling within the Python script. Identifying the provider clearly in the code is a key consideration. I need to make a solid choice.\n\n\n**Selecting Cloud Vision**\n\nNow, I'm leaning toward Google Cloud Vision AI. The choice feels right for label detection. I'll be using its client library to write the `detect_image_labels.py` file. I'm focusing on making sure the provider, Google Cloud Vision AI, is explicitly stated in the code. I'm getting ready to code this now.\n\n\n",
